{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-26","kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之乘圆分角或在心或在界等其所乘之圆分亦等","englishTitle":"In equal circles equal angles stand on equal circumferences, whether they stand at the centres or at the circumferences.","book":3,"number":26,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":26,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-26@raw-374048016782f6a8","contentId":"euclid-3-26","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"374048016782f6a84eb07a19ecb1e1b67683ab4649ee87baf2cdce9e32344959","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-26.statement","euclid-3-26.construction.1","euclid-3-26.construction.2","euclid-3-26.proof.1","euclid-3-26.proof.2","euclid-3-26.proof.3","euclid-3-26.proof.4","euclid-3-26.conclusion","euclid-3-26.historical.1","euclid-3-26.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-26.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-26","revisionId":"euclid-3-26@raw-374048016782f6a8","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7b91949c579970d05555bc5c4f74c9adbd805a775c19a7e0febbc9b34db099e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In equal circles equal angles stand on equal circumferences, whether they stand at the centres or at the circumferences."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在平等圈子中,平等圈子处于平等圈子,无论它们处于中心还是环形圈。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"等圜之乘圜分角或在心或在界等其所乘之圜分亦等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将一个圆乘以弧角要么在圆心，要么在边界等，其弧乘以它也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-26.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-26","revisionId":"euclid-3-26@raw-374048016782f6a8","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dbf31bb458a599a23a3ab61ff2556c3df2941ccd615bfdab7c38b0ca1fef5d19","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be equal circles, and in them let there be equal angles, namely at the centres the angles BGC, EHF, and at the circumferences the angles BAC, EDF; I say that the circumference BKC is equal to the circumference ELF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,DEF成为平等的圈子,在中间,就是在中心,BGC,EHF角度,在环形,BAC,EDF角度;我说,环形BKC等于环形ELF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-26.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-26","revisionId":"euclid-3-26@raw-374048016782f6a8","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa77320b7b7d5c80c5285d309a8947775911ff8bac150c3c1ebc0cdcfecbd2c1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BC, EF be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC,EF连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-26.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-26","revisionId":"euclid-3-26@raw-374048016782f6a8","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"19071dc57d11d5c50b1c6ff28c05624252592084c2a72aebcd9bb29599ce92bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the circles ABC, DEF are equal, the radii are equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,既然ABC,DEF是平等的, radi是平等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-26.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-26","revisionId":"euclid-3-26@raw-374048016782f6a8","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c4688802dfbbe773fdca75f3a9ddf85dd816aadbc6ea1d75f027cb80ee7968d","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus the two straight lines BG, GC are equal to the two straight lines EH, HF; and the angle at G is equal to the angle at H; therefore the base BC is equal to the base EF. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,两条直线BG、GC等于两条直线EH、HF;G的角等于H的角;因此,底边、BC等于底边、EF。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-26.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-26","revisionId":"euclid-3-26@raw-374048016782f6a8","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d6324755949f92adb94fb13e721c6e2d7670793baef27c3c83c94b38b23772f","citations":["euclid-3-def-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the angle at A is equal to the angle at D, the segment BAC is similar to the segment EDF; [[III. Def. 11](/principles/euclid-3-def-11)] and they are upon equal straight lines."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于A的角等于D的角,第BAC段与第EDF段相似;它们处于相等的直线上。 [[III. Def. 11](/principles/euclid-3-def-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-26.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-26","revisionId":"euclid-3-26@raw-374048016782f6a8","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7091cb51336112b994f43c2b472f101b2fa593221531bc1d8dc774634645c97","citations":["euclid-3-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But similar segments of circles on equal straight lines are equal to one another; [[III. 24](/principles/euclid-3-24)] therefore the segment BAC is equal to EDF. But the whole circle ABC is also equal to the whole circle DEF; therefore the circumference BKC which remains is equal to the circumference ELF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但平直线上的类似圆圈段是等同的;因此,BAC段等于EDF,但整个ABC圈也等于整个DEF圈;因此,与ELF圈保持的环形BKC。 [[III. 24](/principles/euclid-3-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-26.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-26","revisionId":"euclid-3-26@raw-374048016782f6a8","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-26.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-26","revisionId":"euclid-3-26@raw-374048016782f6a8","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c29bde272097e3b0b9269de136eefd9f9b96d3b57ea8516983f7c44878cccecb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"等圜之乘圜分角或在心或在界等其所乘之圜分亦等先解在心者曰甲乙丙丁戊己两圜等其心为庚为辛有甲庚丙与丁辛己两乘圜角等题言所乘之甲丙丁己两圜分亦等论曰试于甲乙丙丁戊己两圜分之上任取两点于乙于戊从乙作乙甲乙丙从戊作戊丁戊己各两线次作甲丙丁己两线相联其乙与戊两角既各半于庚辛两角即乙与戊自相等〈本篇二十〉而所负甲乙丙与丁戊己两圜分相似〈本卷界说十〉又甲庚丙角形之甲庚庚丙两边与丁辛己角形之丁辛辛己两边各等庚角与辛角又等即甲丙与丁己两边亦等〈一卷四〉而相似之甲乙丙与丁戊己两圜分在等线上亦等〈本篇卄四〉夫相等圜减相等圜分则所存甲丙丁己两圜分亦等故云等角所乘之圜分等后解在界者曰两圜之乙与戊两乘圜角等题言所乘之甲丙丁己两圜分亦等论曰乙戊两角既等而庚辛两角各倍于乙戊即庚辛自相等〈本篇二十〉依前论甲丙丁己两边亦自相等而甲乙丙与丁戊己两圜分亦等〈本篇廿四〉今于相等圜减相等圜分则所存甲丙丁己两圜分亦等注曰后解极易明盖庚辛角既各倍于乙戊则依先论甲丙丁己自相等〈在心之乘圜角即分圜角随类异名〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在相等的圆中，相等的圆心角或圆周角所对的圆弧也相等。先讨论圆心角：设甲乙丙、丁戊己为相等的圆，圆心分别为庚、辛，并且角甲庚丙等于角丁辛己。在相应圆弧上取点乙、戊，分别连接乙甲、乙丙与戊丁、戊己，再连接甲丙、丁己。因为两个圆周角分别等于相应圆心角的一半，所以角乙等于角戊〈本篇二十〉，相应圆弧甲乙丙与丁戊己因此相似〈本卷界说十〉。两个圆的对应半径甲庚、庚丙与丁辛、辛己分别相等，夹角庚、辛也相等，所以弦甲丙等于弦丁己〈一卷四〉；在等长弦上作出的相似圆弧相等〈本篇卄四〉。从两个相等的整圆中减去相等的圆弧，剩下的圆弧甲丙、丁己也相等。再讨论圆周角：若角乙等于角戊，则相应圆心角庚、辛分别为它们的两倍，因此也相等〈本篇二十〉。依照前面的证明，对应弦和圆弧分别相等〈本篇廿四〉。因此，无论相等的角位于圆心还是圆周，它们所对的圆弧都相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-26.source","contentId":"euclid-3-26","revisionId":"euclid-3-26@raw-374048016782f6a8","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4fb7eba7b6fcdfdaa157e42e51f5cd0f0b96734eb8e509b13ccd962aaeafd319","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-26:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-26","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-26.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-26:euclid-3-def-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-26","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-26.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-def-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26/","sourceLabel":"III. Def. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-26:euclid-3-24:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-26","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-26.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-24","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26/","sourceLabel":"III. 24"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-27:euclid-3-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-27","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-27.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-26","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27/","sourceLabel":"III. 26"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-28:euclid-3-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-28.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-26","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.28","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.28/","sourceLabel":"III. 26"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-3-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-11.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-26","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"III. 26"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-15:euclid-3-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-15","sourc